A||||7||Turkey on Rye||Additional Cooling Fan????||||1||
Z||000000||Turkey on Rye||11-04-2001||07:03 PM||||I was thinking about adding an additional fan to my engine compartment to add in coolin my engine down. I was think of putting it under one of my grills to blow the hot air out more quickly. Any ideas on this? Thanks for any input||||reg||1
Z||000001||avengador1||11-04-2001||07:14 PM||||I've seen someone add 2 fans pre grill, but I think it would be better (and less complicated) to add a hood scoop and opening. This is what I am going to do. I figure it will act like a chimney and let the heat out. <A HREF="http://www.mpmotorsports.net" TARGET=_blank>www.mpmotorsports.net</A>  had a Mustang/Fiero one for $55<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Avendgador1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
